            "Decision ownership"
          ],
          "locator": "section:Transaction Screening Policy \u003e Decision ownership#block:1",
          "text": "The deterministic policy engine owns the clear, investigate, and escalate disposition. Retrieved material and generated analyst notes provide context only and must not change the authoritative decision or review route.",
