          "locator": "section:Transaction Screening Policy \u003e Entity-type conflicts#block:2",
          "text": "When a candidate entity type is incompatible with the screened ISO 20022 field, the case remains investigate unless an independently qualifying primary identifier resolves the conflict. The blocker entity_type_conflict prevents escalation while the conflict remains unresolved.",
